## 示例：基础方块（带 ItemBlock）

```java
// blocks/MyBlock.java
public class MyBlock extends Block implements ITileEntityProvider {
    public MyBlock() {
        super(Properties.create(Material.ROCK)
            .hardnessAndResistance(1.5f, 6.0f)
            .sound(SoundType.STONE)
        );
    }

    @Override
    public TileEntity createNewTileEntity(World world, int meta) {
        return null; // 无特殊需求时返回 null
    }

    @Override
    public void onBlockPlacedBy(World world, BlockPos pos, BlockState state, LivingEntity placer, ItemStack stack) {
        // 方块放置时的逻辑
    }
}
```

```java
// Registration using DeferredRegister (recommended)
public static final DeferredRegister<Block> BLOCKS =
    DeferredRegister.create(ForgeRegistries.BLOCKS, MOD_ID);

public static final RegistryObject<Block> MY_BLOCK =
    BLOCKS.register("my_block", MyBlock::new);
```

## 示例：带 TileEntity 的方块

```java
// blocks/MyBlockEntityBlock.java
public class MyBlockEntityBlock extends Block implements ITileEntityProvider {
    public MyBlockEntityBlock() {
        super(Properties.create(Material.WOOD).noOcclusion());
    }

    @Override
    public TileEntity createNewTileEntity(World world, int meta) {
        return new MyTileEntity();
    }

    @Override
    protected void fillStateContainer(StateContainer.Builder<Block, BlockState> builder) {
        builder.add(FACING);  // 示例：添加一个 FACING 属性
    }
}
```

```java
// entities/MyTileEntity.java
public class MyTileEntity extends TileEntity {
    private NBTTagCompound data = new NBTTagCompound();

    public MyTileEntity() {
        super(ModTileEntities.MY_TILE_ENTITY.get());
    }

    @Override
    public void writeToNBT(NBTTagCompound nbt) {
        super.writeToNBT(nbt);
        nbt.put("data", data.copy());
    }

    @Override
    public void readFromNBT(NBTTagCompound nbt) {
        super.readFromNBT(nbt);
        if (nbt.contains("data", 10)) { // 10 = NBTTagCompound.ID
            this.data = nbt.getCompound("data");
        }
    }
}
```

> 注意：`readFromNBT` 中读取 NBT 是安全的，但你**不能**在 `readFromNBT` 中读取世界数据（如 `world.getBlockState(pos)`）。如需基于世界的逻辑，在 `onLoad()` 或 `markDirty()` 中处理。
